{%- comment -%}
  lb-font-unicode-range.liquid
  Outputs @font-face rules with unicode-range descriptors so the browser
  only downloads the font file subsets that are actually used on the page.
  This pairs with the fonts loaded by snippets/fonts.liquid.

  Targets Latin + Latin Extended only — covers all Legendary Branding
  copy. CJK/Cyrillic/etc subsets are excluded.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  DISABLED: The original @font-face rule used `font-family: inherit` which is
  invalid in an @font-face declaration. To enable unicode-range subsetting,
  each @font-face rule needs explicit font-family names with src descriptors
  matching the actual font files loaded by snippets/fonts.liquid.
  Leaving this file as a no-op until proper font subsetting is implemented.
{%- endcomment -%}